            "review_title": "Review at Belgica",
            "review_text": "Caroline D\n1 contribution\n0\nover priced, unskilled service, don' t go\nSep 2020 • Friends\ni had a diner, the service is totally unskilled (super slow, we are 5 we received food for 1 only, we need to ask basic set : fork, kniffe,...) the price is over price !!! don't waste you money, i order basic food super over price\nWritten September 30, 2020\nEric D\nHi Caroline,\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to give us your feedback. I'm terribly sorry about the slow service that you experienced during your visit. I've recently joined the Belgica management team and we are working on improving. It looks like you visited us during our first month of operation. I sincerely believe that the team has already improved significantly since your visit and we are striving to continually improve. Additionally, we are launching a really nice happy hour in the near future. I would like to personally invite you to come back in and give us another try. Your first round of drinks will be on me. My name is Eric, don't forget to say \"hello\" when you come in. Again, I'm terribly sorry about your experience.\n\nSincerely,\nEric\nRead more\nWritten December 3, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
